---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="页面不存在 · FFmpeg"
  description="你访问的页面不存在。回到首页，或在文档中搜索相关内容。"
>
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[720px] flex-col items-start px-4 py-24 sm:px-6">
    <p class="font-mono text-[13px] text-warn">
      <span class="text-ink-3">$</span> ffmpeg -i /请求的页面/
    </p>
    <pre class="mt-3 rounded-code border border-line bg-elevated px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink-2"><code>Input /请求的页面/ not found.</code></pre>
    <h1 class="mt-8 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">这个地址没有对应的页面</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-[46ch] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">
      文档经常搬家。回首页继续，或直接搜索你想要的内容。
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/" class="rounded-full bg-accent px-5 py-2.5 text-[15px] font-bold text-accent-ink">回到首页</a>
      <a href="/docs/" class="rounded-full border border-line-strong px-5 py-2.5 text-[15px] font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent">浏览文档</a>
      <button
        type="button"
        id="err-search"
        class="rounded-full border border-line-strong px-5 py-2.5 text-[15px] font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent"
      >
        搜索文档
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script>
    document
      .getElementById("err-search")
      ?.addEventListener("click", () =>
        window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent("ffmpeg:search"))
      );
  </script>
</Base>
